              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo nsohotse nkaja ku gahinga, nsanga abariritswe n’inkota; nashika mu gisagara, ngasanga abazingamitswe n’inzara! Kuko ba kamenyi n’abaherezi bagendagenda mu gihugu ata co bazi.",
          "type": "text",
